            <ul class="studies-list">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/StelexarasApp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stelexaras Camps App</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">.NET C#</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">A management system for summer camps. It helps camp staff (HR and management team leaders) track children organisation, staff, camp structure (eg tents, communities) in real time</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/SpotifySongsTracker" target="blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spotify Songs Tracker</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">ASP.NET C#</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">SpotifySongsTracker helps users track their favorite Spotify playlists and songs. The app uses Spotify's OAuth for authentication, and users must provide their own credentials.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/UEFA-Ranking-App" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UEFA Ranking App</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">Blazor C#</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">FootballRankings tracks rankings based on European UEFA club matches across the 3 main competitions. This project is for non-commercial use!</span>
                </li>                
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/GreekMuencheners" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Greek Müncheners</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">HTML - CSS</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">A website for the Greek community in Munich, built with Blazor. It has a calendar with upcoming events, a list of the community's WhatsApp groups, Contact form and history of past events</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/VolleyNotie" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">VolleyBall Notie</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">Python </span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">A python scraper, that checks a public html content of a volleyball matches website and notifies us via email for new matches</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/Emergy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Emergy</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">WPF and Xamarin C#</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">SOS application (Xamarin Forms) for users who get lost, with a municipal-service application (WPF) to find them</span>
                </li>                
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/Thesis" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Thesis</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">Jupyter Notebook and Python</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">University thesis: In this research, we analyze and present the application of the Universal Language Model Fine Tuning technique (ULMFiT) in some text categorization applications, developed by NLP's fast.ai </span>
                </li>                                
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/GeorgiosDimopoulos/MyEncryptedMessaging" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MyEncryptedMessaging</a>
                    <span class="repo-lang">Console C#</span>
                    <span class="repo-desc">Cloud Security - Encrypted messaging simple attempt. We decode and encode the message with a real timespan trick</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
